{
    "title": "Zip News: Latest & Alerts",
    "description": "Zip News is committed to providing a personalized news experience, delivering up-to-the-minute updates on various topics such as local events, business, politics, technology, entertainment, and sports, sourced from trusted outlets around the globe.\r\n\r\n<b>Here's what you'll find</b>\r\n\u2022 <b>Breaking News Alerts</b>: Receive instant notifications about breaking stories from all publishers.\r\n\u2022 <b>Latest & Local News</b>: Get comprehensive, personalized coverage of both major and minor stories.\r\n\u2022 <b>Weather Updates</b>: Access real-time weather alerts, including forecasts for the next 72 hours and 14 days.\r\n\r\n<b>Customized News Feed</b>\r\n\u2022 <b>Personalized Content</b>: Our algorithm curates news based on your interests from thousands of daily articles.\r\n\u2022 <b>Top Stories</b>: Never miss the headline! Follow the latest major news and events on a national and local scale.\r\n\u2022 <b>Trusted Sources</b>: Zip News aggregates content from thousands of reliable sources.\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer (For Publishers)</b>\r\nZip News is a content/RSS feed aggregator, aiming to make accessing news stories easier and reach a larger audience. If you are a news publisher, please read this:\r\n\u2022 If your website is listed in our apps, this means that we are using your RSS feeds. We believe fair use is beneficial for you and our users. However, if you want us to remove your website, just contact us, and we will do it as soon as possible.\r\n\u2022 If your website is listed and you want it to be a trusted source in our app, which will give you more visibility and traffic, please contact us.\r\n\u2022 If your website, newspaper, or blog is not listed, you can contact us to add it.\r\nPlease contact us by email: easemobileteam@gmail.com\r\n\r\n*Web version: https://topfeed.info/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Zip News is committed to providing a personalized news experience, delivering up-to-the-minute updates on various topics such as local events, business, politics, technology, entertainment, and sports, sourced from trusted outlets around the globe.<br><br><b>Here&#39;s what you&#39;ll find</b><br>\u2022 <b>Breaking News Alerts</b>: Receive instant notifications about breaking stories from all publishers.<br>\u2022 <b>Latest &amp; Local News</b>: Get comprehensive, personalized coverage of both major and minor stories.<br>\u2022 <b>Weather Updates</b>: Access real-time weather alerts, including forecasts for the next 72 hours and 14 days.<br><br><b>Customized News Feed</b><br>\u2022 <b>Personalized Content</b>: Our algorithm curates news based on your interests from thousands of daily articles.<br>\u2022 <b>Top Stories</b>: Never miss the headline! Follow the latest major news and events on a national and local scale.<br>\u2022 <b>Trusted Sources</b>: Zip News aggregates content from thousands of reliable sources.<br><br><b>Disclaimer (For Publishers)</b><br>Zip News is a content/RSS feed aggregator, aiming to make accessing news stories easier and reach a larger audience. If you are a news publisher, please read this:<br>\u2022 If your website is listed in our apps, this means that we are using your RSS feeds. We believe fair use is beneficial for you and our users. However, if you want us to remove your website, just contact us, and we will do it as soon as possible.<br>\u2022 If your website is listed and you want it to be a trusted source in our app, which will give you more visibility and traffic, please contact us.<br>\u2022 If your website, newspaper, or blog is not listed, you can contact us to add it.<br>Please contact us by email: easemobileteam@gmail.com<br><br>*Web version: https://topfeed.info/",
